{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56761","headline":"陈蔡女鬼与长孙绍祖歌（题拟） 二 · 不详","name":"陈蔡女鬼与长孙绍祖歌（题拟） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星汉纵复斜，风霜凄已切。\n薄陈君不御，谁知思欲绝。\n（见《太平广记》卷三二六引《志怪录》）（按：六朝人所着小说以《志怪》爲书名者有多种，鲁迅辑入《古小说鈎沉》，不录此条。\n长孙爲塞北胡姓，似不应见於南朝小说中，宋朱翌《猗觉寮杂记》卷上引张荐《灵怪集》，有东蔡女鬼与裴绍祖诗二句：「横陈君不御，惟知思不绝。\n」疑《广记》所注书名有误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}